      units          real
      atom_style     full
      pair_style     table linear 250
      bond_style     table linear 499
      angle_style    table linear 361

      neighbor       5.0 bin
      neigh_modify   every 1 delay 2 check yes
      boundary       p p p
      special_bonds  lj 0.0 0.0 1.0
